#. module: product_model
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:product_model.action_product_model_code
msgid "Create a product model"
msgstr "创建一条产品型号"

#. module: product_model
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:product_model.action_product_model_code
msgid ""
"A product can carry several models (customer / factory / alias). They are "
"usually maintained on the \"Models\" page of the product form; this view is "
"meant for bulk search and maintenance."
msgstr ""
"一个产品可挂多条型号（客户型号 / 工厂型号 / 别名）。通常在产品表单的「型号」页内维护，此处用于批量检索与维护。"

#. module: product_model
#: model:ir.actions.act_window,name:product_model.action_product_model_code
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:product_model.product_model_code_list_view
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:product_model.product_model_code_search_view
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:product_model.product_template_form_inherit
msgid "Product Models"
msgstr "产品型号"

#. module: product_model
#: model:ir.model,name:product_model.model_product_model_code
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:product_model.product_model_code_form_view
msgid "Product Model"
msgstr "产品型号"

#. module: product_model
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:product_model.product_model_code_form_view
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:product_model.product_template_form_inherit
msgid "e.g. MODEL-A, SKU-1234"
msgstr "如 MODEL-A、SKU-1234"

#. module: product_model
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:product_model.product_model_code_form_view
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:product_model.product_template_form_inherit
msgid "Optional, e.g. customer / version / effective date"
msgstr "可选，如对应客户 / 版本 / 生效日期"

#. module: product_model
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:product_model.product_model_code_search_view
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_model.field_product_model_code__active
msgid "Active"
msgstr "启用"

#. module: product_model
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:product_model.product_model_code_search_view
msgid "Archived"
msgstr "停用"

#. module: product_model
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:product_model.product_template_form_inherit
msgid "Models"
msgstr "型号"

#. module: product_model
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_model.field_product_template__model_code_line_ids
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:product_model.product_template_form_inherit
msgid "Model Lines"
msgstr "型号明细"

#. module: product_model
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:product_model.product_template_form_inherit
msgid ""
"Hint: models cannot be repeated inside the same product, but the same model "
"may be used by other products. Searching a product by any of its models finds "
"this product."
msgstr "提示：同一产品内型号不可重复；不同产品间可重复。搜索产品时按任一型号均可命中本产品。"

#. module: product_model
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:product_model.product_template_list_inherit
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:product_model.product_template_search_inherit
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_model.field_product_model_code__model_code
msgid "Model"
msgstr "型号"

#. module: product_model
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_model.field_product_model_code__model_code
msgid ""
"Model code of the product. It cannot be repeated inside the same product, but "
"the same code may be used by other products; when a search hits a model, the "
"result shows \"Product (Matching model: xxx)\" to tell them apart."
msgstr ""
"产品型号，同一产品内不可重复；不同产品间可重复，搜索时命中会显示「产品名（命中型号：xxx）」以区分。"

#. module: product_model
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_model.field_product_model_code__model_type
msgid "Model Type"
msgstr "型号类型"

#. module: product_model
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:product_model.selection__product_model_code__model_type__customer
msgid "Customer Model"
msgstr "客户型号"

#. module: product_model
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:product_model.selection__product_model_code__model_type__factory
msgid "Factory Model"
msgstr "工厂型号"

#. module: product_model
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:product_model.selection__product_model_code__model_type__alias
msgid "Alias"
msgstr "别名"

#. module: product_model
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_model.field_product_model_code__model_type
msgid ""
"Purpose of this model: customer models are used on outgoing documents, "
"factory models for purchasing, aliases for historical or colloquial names."
msgstr "区分该型号的用途：客户型号用于对外单据，工厂型号用于采购，别名用于历史/俗称匹配。"

#. module: product_model
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_model.field_product_model_code__sequence
msgid "Sequence"
msgstr "排序"

#. module: product_model
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_model.field_product_model_code__sequence
msgid ""
"Lower values come first; both the list and the One2many lines are ordered by "
"this value."
msgstr "数值小的排在前面，列表与 One2many 行均按此排序。"

#. module: product_model
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_model.field_product_model_code__active
msgid "Uncheck to disable a model without deleting it, so history is kept."
msgstr "取消勾选可停用某条型号而不删除，便于保留历史。"

#. module: product_model
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_model.field_product_model_code__note
msgid "Note"
msgstr "备注"

#. module: product_model
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_model.field_product_model_code__note
msgid ""
"Short description of this model (customer, version, effective date, ...)."
msgstr "对该型号的简短说明（如对应客户、版本、生效日期等）。"

#. module: product_model
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_model.field_product_model_code__product_tmpl_id
msgid "Product"
msgstr "产品"

#. module: product_model
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_model.field_product_model_code__product_tmpl_id
msgid ""
"Product template this model belongs to; models are removed together with the "
"product."
msgstr "该型号所属的产品模板；删除产品时型号行随之级联清理。"

#. module: product_model
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_model.field_product_template__model_code_line_ids
msgid "All models of this product (customer / factory / alias)."
msgstr "该产品的所有型号（客户型号 / 工厂型号 / 别名）。"

#. module: product_model
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_model.field_product_template__model_code_count
msgid "Model Count"
msgstr "型号数量"

#. module: product_model
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:product_model.field_product_template__model_code_index
msgid "Model Search Index"
msgstr "型号搜索索引"

#. module: product_model
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_model.field_product_template__model_code_index
msgid ""
"Search index built by concatenating all models of this product. It is "
"maintained automatically when model lines change; do not edit it manually."
msgstr "该产品所有型号拼接后的搜索索引，由型号行增删改时自动维护，请勿手工编辑。"

#. module: product_model
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:product_model.constraint_model_code_unique_per_template
msgid "Model codes must be unique within the same product."
msgstr "同一产品内型号不可重复。"

#. module: product_model
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_model/models/product_model_code.py:0
msgid ""
"The model \"%(code)s\" already exists for product \"%(product)s\". Model codes "
"must be unique within the same product."
msgstr "型号“%(code)s”在产品“%(product)s”中已存在，同一产品内型号不可重复。"

#. module: product_model
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_model/models/product_template.py:0
msgid " (Matching model: %(codes)s)"
msgstr "（命中型号：%(codes)s）"
